diagnostics/type-tests.em:27:12: Animal has no method named `bark`
      shared.bark()
             ^^^^
`bark` belongs to `Dog`, which extends Animal. A test such as `shared is Dog` cannot prove what `shared` holds, because a function assigns it and could change it in between. Copy it into a `const` first, and test that.
